  "takeaways": [
    "Market structure organizes price by its meaningful highs and lows, and the relationship between them.",
    "Price moves in swings: push, pullback, push, pullback.",
    "A few candles in one direction don’t define structure on their own."
  ],
  "remember": "Start with what price has already shown you, not where you think it’s going."
